    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The grand opening performance thus began. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is I who pen this, setting it in stone. I previously invited you to this grand dance of the universe! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361120/extras/11603298a244d0b982dcbca61abe2e81.avif?t=1752763157\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a card-based negotiation battle with the guests. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361120/extras/a3a6ebc86feb5cb33164e4f892a2842c.avif?t=1752763157\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain a powerful ability inheritance card. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enrich the reading experience of the plot </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361120/extras/b31800d1402c4d911d8f6fa6b597c9da.avif?t=1752763157\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more diligently you serve, the more abundantly you will receive. Please also respect yourself and do not lose your true self. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Named the Scribe, from the beginning of the scarlet, together we will reignite the glory of you and the past! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
